-Each round is stressapptest -M <fresh free MiB minus 10> -m 8 -s 3600 -W
--l <round log>, sleep 30, memtester <fresh free MiB minus 10> 1, BIN unpack
-1000 times, TAR unpack 500 times, CPU status, sleep 2, sync. Thus -c 12 means
-12 hours of stressapptest PLUS all other tests and delays, NOT a 12-hour
-total deadline. --seconds changes only stressapptest duration. --unpack is
-accepted for compatibility but is now already the default.
