-That separate binary is no longer included or selected. Validate one iteration
-with the board tool before 12 full rounds; an unpack failure alone is not a
-DDR fault. The suite also checks MD5 because vendor tools can exit zero after
-reporting extraction failure. For memory-only tests use --no-unpack. No
-fixture/checksum has been changed to hide failures. The TAR fixture and all
-five expected file MD5s were checked on the host. Manifests are normalized
-from CRLF to LF only; expected hashes are unchanged. Never replace --unpack
-with --update.
